      "code": "no-concrete-anchor",
      "message": "Add at least one concrete anchor (a number, a date like "last Tuesday", a proper name, or a quoted line). Vagueness is AI tell #1.",
      "severity": "soft",
    },
  ],
  "needsRepair": true,
}
`;

